                                "example_id": "b7e2286e-dee4-40d2-ae67-05bef9f133ff",
                                "sense_id": "128983d5-30d7-3b36-9a47-a41ce99c7693",
                                "text": "Он заставляет Цимермана, богатого торговца строительным материалом, Алешинского, владельца скобяного магазина, и других купцов отпустить материал на строительство церкви как бы в кредит, а потом деньги не брать."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "051e6458-632d-3bd9-ab75-d8476f0abb16",
                        "entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., офиц. выдать, выделить, ассигновать что-либо кому-то"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d43d292c-38d7-442f-8307-2caeb3393de1",
                                "sense_id": "051e6458-632d-3bd9-ab75-d8476f0abb16",
                                "text": "Директор никаких приказов об экспедиции не подписывал, а попросту распорядился отпустить под личную расписку какую-то сумму из статьи «на приобретение экспонатов»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3af70856-bbcf-3cff-ba52-f5edfa163c78",
                        "entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., отрастить, позволить расти"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "о волосяном покрове"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e026193-04e5-43ea-9e43-178c878ef02a",
                                "sense_id": "3af70856-bbcf-3cff-ba52-f5edfa163c78",
                                "text": "Следует приказать всем будочникам и другим нижним полицейским служителям отпустить такие же бороды и, для вернейшего успеха, отпустить их в некотором карикатурном виде."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eadf060d-b4a9-36af-b02f-b3ab4c2677d1",
                        "entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг., высказать; сделать эмоциональное высказывание"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "с доп."
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74b29bdf-09eb-4e73-9079-9383b5944671",
                                "sense_id": "eadf060d-b4a9-36af-b02f-b3ab4c2677d1",
                                "text": "Савелий скривил улыбку, хотел отпустить шутку, но ничего путного не придумал и лишь передразнил его акцент."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17c1edba-9dc7-3a4e-bb67-9270a66faaa5",
                        "entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "металл. подвергнуть термической обработке для увеличения прочности и пластичности металла"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57e36745-98bc-324d-80f2-f332b9f1d92e",
                        "entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., сленг, безл. выйти из состояния наркотического бреда"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a9d6851-1b87-41e1-a1f5-8d04beb437a2",
                                "sense_id": "57e36745-98bc-324d-80f2-f332b9f1d92e",
                                "text": "Его отпустило только через три часа."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c11e9390-9cc6-4a7a-82ae-4a47cf89e517",
                        "source_entry_id": "aa106893-0490-3442-a666-f7ee25cb820b",
                        "source_sense_description": "позволить уйти",
                        "target_lang_word": "let go",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "let go",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To release from one's grasp; to go from a state of holding on to a state of no longer holding on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive",
                                            "with-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57eb679a-311c-4694-808a-e3fbc03a1727",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                                "text": "You're hurting him! Let him go!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6bc230f-8176-4068-948a-ca6b49e8be4d",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                                "text": "Let go of the phone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba80477f-b323-4ef3-ab2c-3103aa306795",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                                "text": "He had one hand on the bounce bottle—and he'd never let go of that since he got back to the table—but he had a handkerchief in the other and was swabbing his deadlights with it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d707b1b8-5b16-46e9-961f-5c564d3d69b5",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                                "text": "But it wasn’t ransom enough.\nHis captors accepted it all,\nBut didn’t let go of the king."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fceab8d2-f9d4-4200-8be9-f27175e8019b",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb42b14-baa6-3bd7-93ad-b4a94e172c7e",
                                                "text": "Falling from cloud nine / Crashing from the high / I'm letting go tonight / Yeah, I'm falling from cloud nine"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a986f567-1dc9-39b5-8043-38b6bc3a453b",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To emotionally disengage or distract oneself from a situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a82dfe9a-d5f6-49bf-8753-9f078a8f3a31",
                                                "sense_id": "a986f567-1dc9-39b5-8043-38b6bc3a453b",
                                                "text": "You are supported, so you can just let go and relax. Inhale and slowly exhale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "131eab11-2578-37c6-bb2e-60d9fd0249e8",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dismiss from employment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a767146-af68-433b-ace2-231f81e72f28",
                                                "sense_id": "131eab11-2578-37c6-bb2e-60d9fd0249e8",
                                                "text": "The secretary didn't work out, so her boss told her she was being let go."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61f9fcba-bb5e-4143-a6a8-1cea42223aad",
                                                "sense_id": "131eab11-2578-37c6-bb2e-60d9fd0249e8",
                                                "text": "Puel was let go in June despite leading Southampton to their first major final for 14 years and an eighth-place finish in the Premier League. But apparently his style was too boring and some players and many fans disliked his method, so he had to go – fair enough but look at them now."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d27ff529-594d-375b-97c6-3c5cdaca428c",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ignore (a comment, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "717155cb-04cb-4923-8764-b01623a0a14f",
                                                "sense_id": "d27ff529-594d-375b-97c6-3c5cdaca428c",
                                                "text": "Cora gave her shoulders a rebellious toss. \"I'm sick of always getting oysters; I'd sooner come out with you.\" Bradly let that go. \"You had enough money this week without getting oysters, didn't you?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5177730-5c81-3477-882e-e3546791f2c1",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fail to maintain a standard of appearance, behavior, or performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd5206e-337a-3575-ac63-03d9becaff83",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fail to maintain a standard of appearance, behavior, or performance.",
                                            "To gain weight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "badbfc82-abd1-4a46-82a0-84627b380d46",
                                                "sense_id": "8fd5206e-337a-3575-ac63-03d9becaff83",
                                                "text": "Wow, dude! You've really let yourself go this time!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a52d039-930f-3b78-8de0-ff586febfc1b",
                                        "entry_id": "96061a50-70f1-37c5-9704-64362b080e05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see let, go."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e218c44-47b9-4c38-83c2-5176b40e4c36",
                                                "sense_id": "6a52d039-930f-3b78-8de0-ff586febfc1b",
                                                "text": "Please, Mom, can you let me go to her party?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89415989-1a10-4e12-8100-221b1590c407",
                                                "sense_id": "6a52d039-930f-3b78-8de0-ff586febfc1b",
                                                "text": "We shan’t let our old car go to anyone for less than 15 grand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
